@page "/you-hold-the-keys"
<PageTitle>You hold the keys · Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <h1 class="ta-page-headline">You hold the keys</h1>
    <p class="ta-page-sub">A new company should have to earn your trust. So we built Tangent Atlas to need as little of it as possible.</p>

    <div class="ta-trust">
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10l9-6 9 6"></path><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="5" y2="18"></line><line x1="10" y1="10" x2="10" y2="18"></line><line x1="14" y1="10" x2="14" y2="18"></line><line x1="19" y1="10" x2="19" y2="18"></line><line x1="3" y1="20" x2="21" y2="20"></line></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">Your money stays in your name</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">It never leaves your bank or your broker. We never hold it.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"></path></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">We never see your passwords</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">You sign in at your own bank, and you can turn off our access at any time.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"></line><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"></line><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="#ffffff"></circle><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="2.2" fill="#ffffff"></circle></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">You decide how far it goes</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">Start by just looking. Let it act only when you’re ready, and pause everything with one click.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-trust-card">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline><polyline points="16 6 22 12 16 18"></polyline></svg>
            <div class="ta-trust-title">Read the code</div>
            <div class="ta-trust-body">The software that handles your money is open source, published on GitHub under the Apache 2.0 licence.</div>
            <a href="https://github.com/tangent-atlas" class="ta-trust-link">See it on GitHub →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ta-page-final">
        <p class="ta-page-close">Your house, your rules.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</div>
